{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/194076-the-most-insane-scenario-you-ran","id":194076,"title":"The Most Insane Scenario you ran?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-10T16:10:37-07:00","id":194076,"title":"The Most Insane Scenario you ran?","content":"my players are very into comic books. and i been thinking on taking some scenarios from comics, such as the Center Invation (using a lovecraftian twist), Kingdom come and possibly Crisis on infinite earths. but have you ever copy pasted a scenario from a comic/book/movie other than the canon ones?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T21:45:22-07:00","id":194328,"title":"","content":"No, though I did have a Trinity group hunting down a rogue biokinetic vigilante in Buenos Aires, who adopted a bat-like form and called himself Camazotz. Criminals, he thought, were a superstitious and cowardly lot.<br /> <br /> Prior to that the same group was rescuing a scientist who specialized in the Kuwasha Pulse from cybernetically-enhanced Nihonjin agents, in the slums of the San Fran arcology. I think the team biokinetic bodyslammed one of them by jumping off a building.<br /> <br /> And prior to that they were running and gunning against the Wargang (Shattered Europe) in a French Alps town... as latents. Fertilizer bombs were employed. Good times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3453-nephandi","name":"Nephandi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T20:27:33-07:00","id":197374,"title":"","content":"Well, a lot of years ago i played in a high-powered New Gods/Cosmic Marvel kind of space opera setting, centered in the Theocracy, the expansionist star empire of a civilization of super beings that conquered more primitive worlds by sending their young as &quot;star gods&quot; to evangelize/take over each planet's natives as servants, slaves &amp; worshippers until the time their parents or older relatives came from the void to bring them back into the fold - and complications that ensue when <b>another</b> group of star gods, among other stranger things, come out from a region of space their empire had avoided in the last millenia.<br /> <br /> the result was a chronicle heavy in interestelar cross-pantheon intrigue, cosmic mysteries and reality-shattering dark secrets (sometimes literally) and overpowered imagery hijinks like an invading aerial citadel covering half an hemisphere, ressurection by temporal manipulation, a planet undone by relocating a black hole into its center, lobotomizing a living planet with two coordinated Death Star level quantum bolts and a god that sacrificed himself imprisoning a trio of cosmic lovecraftian horrors in a point in time and space that was erased of reality, among other utterly insane stuff. Fun times. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 11-08-2014, 12:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}